{{name}} version
{{name}} help
```

## The four surfaces

Scaffolded by [aiscaffold](https://github.com/danishvirani/aiscaffold). Everything is wired up:

- **CLI** — `src/cli.js`, a plain-ESM Node binary. Add commands by adding a case to `run`.
- **Claude Code plugin** — `plugins/{{name}}/`: a manifest, a slash command per CLI command, and an auto-loading bootstrap skill. Use it with `claude --plugin-dir ./plugins/{{name}}` or symlink it into `~/.claude/plugins/`.
- **MCP server** — `src/mcp.js`, a hand-rolled stdio JSON-RPC server using only built-in `JSON` and `node:readline`. Run it with `{{name}} mcp`.
- **brief command** — `{{name}} brief` prints a Markdown context block to paste at the start of an AI session, so the agent starts with the project's shape already loaded.

## Develop

```bash
./install.sh                 # writes a launcher → ~/.local/bin/{{name}}
node --test                  # run the test suite (built-in runner, no deps)
node --check src/cli.js      # syntax-check a file
```

